{
  "name": "Elemental Defense: Enveloping Winds (Air)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain access to this element, as a Bonus Action, you can surround yourself with a whirling torrent of air or a static field of crackling lightning, which lasts until you dismiss the effect (no action required).</p><p>While the effect is active and you aren't wearing any armor or shield, your AC equals 10 + your Dexterity modifier + your Charisma modifier and all ranged weapon attacks against you are made with Disadvantage. Additionally, any gas, vapor, or fog that can be dispersed by a strong wind has no effect on you.</p><p>This effect is exclusive with Elemental Defense class features from other Elemental Schools.</p>",
